{"seq":3,"slug":"typechecker-and-symbols","title":"TypeChecker 与 Symbol 系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/typescript-compiler-api/foundations/typechecker-and-symbols","wordCount":609,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"typechecker-与-symbol-系统\">TypeChecker 与 Symbol 系统</h1><p>TypeChecker 是 TypeScript 编译器中最核心也最复杂的组件——它将纯语法的 AST 节点与语义层的类型信息连接起来。当你需要知道&quot;这个变量是什么类型&quot;、&quot;这个函数调用是否类型安全&quot;、&quot;这个泛型实例化后的结果是什么&quot;时，TypeChecker 是唯一的答案来源。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>TypeChecker 的工作建立在 Binder 产出的 Symbol Table 之上。三个核心概念形成了一个层次关系：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    N[AST Node] --&gt;|getSymbolAtLocation| S[Symbol]&#10;    S --&gt;|getTypeOfSymbol| T[Type]&#10;    T --&gt;|getProperties| S2[Symbol members]&#10;    T --&gt;|getCallSignatures| CS[CallSignature]&#10;    T --&gt;|getBaseTypes| BT[Base Types]&#10;    S --&gt;|getDeclarations| N2[Declaration Nodes]\">graph TD\n    N[AST Node] --&gt;|getSymbolAtLocation| S[Symbol]\n    S --&gt;|getTypeOfSymbol| T[Type]\n    T --&gt;|getProperties| S2[Symbol members]\n    T --&gt;|getCallSignatures| CS[CallSignature]\n    T --&gt;|getBaseTypes| BT[Base Types]\n    S --&gt;|getDeclarations| N2[Declaration Nodes]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>接口</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>获取方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Node</td>\n<td><code>ts.Node</code></td>\n<td>源码中的语法结构</td>\n<td>Parser 创建</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Symbol</td>\n<td><code>ts.Symbol</code></td>\n<td>一个命名实体（变量、函数、类、属性等）</td>\n<td><code>checker.getSymbolAtLocation(node)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Type</td>\n<td><code>ts.Type</code></td>\n<td>一个值可能具有的类型信息</td>\n<td><code>checker.getTypeAtLocation(node)</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键区别：<strong>一个 Symbol 可能对应多个声明节点</strong>（如函数重载、接口合并），<strong>一个 Type 可以通过不同 Symbol 到达</strong>（如类型别名）。Symbol 是&quot;名字到声明&quot;的桥梁，Type 是&quot;声明到类型结构&quot;的桥梁。</p>\n<h2 id=\"创建-program-与获取-typechecker\">创建 Program 与获取 TypeChecker</h2><p>TypeChecker 不能独立创建——它依附于 Program 对象。Program 代表一次完整的编译单元，包含所有源文件和编译选项：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import ts from &#39;typescript&#39;;&#10;&#10;// 方式一：从 tsconfig.json 创建&#10;const configPath = ts.findConfigFile(process.cwd(), ts.sys.fileExists, &#39;tsconfig.json&#39;);&#10;const configFile = ts.readConfigFile(configPath!, ts.sys.readFile);&#10;const parsedConfig = ts.parseJsonConfigFileContent(configFile.config, ts.sys, process.cwd());&#10;&#10;const program = ts.createProgram(parsedConfig.fileNames, parsedConfig.options);&#10;&#10;// 方式二：直接指定文件和选项&#10;const program2 = ts.createProgram([&#39;src/index.ts&#39;], {&#10;  target: ts.ScriptTarget.ES2020,&#10;  module: ts.ModuleKind.ESNext,&#10;  strict: true,&#10;});&#10;&#10;const checker = program.getTypeChecker();\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ts </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'typescript'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 方式一：从 tsconfig.json 创建</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> configPath</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ts.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">findConfigFile</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(process.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cwd</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(), ts.sys.fileExists, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'tsconfig.json'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> configFile</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ts.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">readConfigFile</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(configPath</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, ts.sys.readFile);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> parsedConfig</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ts.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">parseJsonConfigFileContent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(configFile.config, ts.sys, process.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cwd</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> program</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ts.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">createProgram</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(parsedConfig.fileNames, parsedConfig.options);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 方式二：直接指定文件和选项</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> program2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ts.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">createProgram</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'src/index.ts'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">], {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  target: ts.ScriptTarget.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">ES2020</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  module: ts.ModuleKind.ESNext,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  strict: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> checker</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> program.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getTypeChecker</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"symbol-查询与导航\">Symbol 查询与导航</h2><p>Symbol 是连接&quot;名字出现位置&quot;与&quot;名字定义位置&quot;的核心抽象。通过 TypeChecker 你可以从任何标识符节点获取其对应的 Symbol：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function analyzeExports(sourceFile: ts.SourceFile, checker: ts.TypeChecker) {&#10;  const moduleSymbol = checker.getSymbolAtLocation(sourceFile);&#10;  if (!moduleSymbol) return;&#10;&#10;  const exports = checker.getExportsOfModule(moduleSymbol);&#10;  for (const exportSymbol of exports) {&#10;    const type = checker.getTypeOfSymbolAtLocation(exportSymbol, exportSymbol.valueDeclaration!);&#10;    console.log(`export ${exportSymbol.getName()}: ${checker.typeToString(type)}`);&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> analyzeExports</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">sourceFile</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ts</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">SourceFile</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">checker</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ts</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">TypeChecker</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> moduleSymbol</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> checker.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getSymbolAtLocation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(sourceFile);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">moduleSymbol) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> exports</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> checker.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getExportsOfModule</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(moduleSymbol);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> exportSymbol</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> exports</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> checker.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getTypeOfSymbolAtLocation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(exportSymbol, exportSymbol.valueDeclaration</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`export ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">exportSymbol</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getName</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">()</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}: ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">checker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">typeToString</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">type</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">)</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Symbol 的 <code>flags</code> 属性标识了它的种类：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"if (symbol.flags &amp; ts.SymbolFlags.Function) {&#10;  /* 函数 */&#10;}&#10;if (symbol.flags &amp; ts.SymbolFlags.Interface) {&#10;  /* 接口 */&#10;}&#10;if (symbol.flags &amp; ts.SymbolFlags.Variable) {&#10;  /* 变量 */&#10;}&#10;if (symbol.flags &amp; ts.SymbolFlags.Class) {&#10;  /* 类 */&#10;}&#10;if (symbol.flags &amp; ts.SymbolFlags.TypeAlias) {&#10;  /* 类型别名 */&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (symbol.flags </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ts.SymbolFlags.Function) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  /* 函数 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (symbol.flags </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ts.SymbolFlags.Interface) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  /* 接口 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (symbol.flags </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ts.SymbolFlags.Variable) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  /* 变量 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (symbol.flags </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ts.SymbolFlags.Class) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  /* 类 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (symbol.flags </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ts.SymbolFlags.TypeAlias) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  /* 类型别名 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"type-系统查询\">Type 系统查询</h2><p>Type 对象表示 TypeScript 类型系统中的一个具体类型。它的结构比 Symbol 更复杂，因为类型可以是联合、交叉、条件、映射等复合形式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function inspectType(type: ts.Type, checker: ts.TypeChecker) {&#10;  // 基本类型标志&#10;  if (type.flags &amp; ts.TypeFlags.String) return &#39;string&#39;;&#10;  if (type.flags &amp; ts.TypeFlags.Number) return &#39;number&#39;;&#10;  if (type.flags &amp; ts.TypeFlags.Boolean) return &#39;boolean&#39;;&#10;&#10;  // 联合类型&#10;  if (type.isUnion()) {&#10;    return type.types.map((t) =&gt; checker.typeToString(t)).join(&#39; | &#39;);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  // 对象类型：获取属性&#10;  if (type.flags &amp; ts.TypeFlags.Object) {&#10;    const properties = type.getProperties();&#10;    const propTypes = properties.map((p) =&gt; {&#10;      const propType = checker.getTypeOfSymbolAtLocation(p, p.valueDeclaration!);&#10;      return `${p.getName()}: ${checker.typeToString(propType)}`;&#10;    });&#10;    return `{ ${propTypes.join(&#39;; &#39;)} }`;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return checker.typeToString(type);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> inspectType</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ts</span><span style=\"co